{
  "source_revision": "7433524020514b3907653c5a3fe3b95212ae8f59",
  "scope": "228 handwritten declarations in 37 companion production modules. Record fields are assessed with their structure; generated projections and elaborator declarations are not separate handwritten entries. The computational pair remains separately unreviewed.",
  "declaration_count": 228,
  "changes": [
    "26 docstrings: six public lemmas, five Node.Counted fields and fifteen private helpers",
    "Remove two unused simp arguments in Descriptor.constraints_at_root",
    "Omit unused real-closedness for domain-only determine_convert_isSome",
    "Checked-system proof clients use the full System.check_eq API or named guard projections; their statements and semantic hypotheses are unchanged.",
    "Existing recursive producer proof consumes full leaf/split acceptance equivalences; statements and recursion invariants are preserved.",
    "Common-product and re-encoding producer proofs consume the full check_iff/checkReencoding_iff equivalences; statements are unchanged.",
    "Supplied-replay rootsFrom_coverage and rootsFrom_ordered generalize existing proof compositions; buildRoots_coverage and buildRoots_ordered delegate without changed statements. No coefficient Neg/Inv assumptions on supplied-replay exports."
  ],
